WEBVTT

00:00:00.740 --> 00:00:03.770
Everyone, Kaleido Star is about to start.

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:06.480
When you watch Kaleido Star,
please keep your room bright,

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:09.540
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:14.410
Well, well, well.
Do you have anybody you admire?

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:16.450
Someone, you think, she is cool, wonderful,

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:18.720
or someone you wish you could be like her.

00:00:18.890 --> 00:00:20.720
To me, that is Miss Layla.

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:24.590
This is a chance that I may be able to
appear on stage with the person I admire.

00:00:24.690 --> 00:00:27.660
I have to get this chance by all means!
I have to! I have to!

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:45.710
<i>Yaritai koto wa nani</i>

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:45.710
<i>What is it that you want to do?</i>

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.380
<i>Sou kikareru tabi</i>

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:49.380
<i>Every time I was asked that</i>

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:53.110
<i>Aoi sora miageta</i>

00:00:50.090 --> 00:00:53.110
<i>I looked up at the blue sky</i>

00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:57.130
<i>Kotae wa only my heart</i>

00:00:53.890 --> 00:00:57.130
<i>The answer is only in my heart</i>

00:00:57.130 --> 00:01:04.630
<i>Honto ni daiji na kotoba wa
kantan ni wa iwanai</i>

00:00:57.130 --> 00:01:04.630
<i>I don't easily say the words
that are really important</i>

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:11.940
<i>Hikari ga yubisasu basho e to hashiridasu yo</i>

00:01:04.630 --> 00:01:11.940
<i>I start running towards the place
the light points to</i>

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:19.880
<i>Dakishimetai mono nara
nakitai hodo mune ni aru</i>

00:01:11.940 --> 00:01:19.880
<i>There's so much in my heart that I want
to embrace, I could cry</i>

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:26.860
<i>Egakitsuzukete yuku kitto
take it someday</i>

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:26.860
<i>I'll keep painting my way, I promise,
take it someday</i>

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:34.830
<i>Shiroi kumo ga nagareru
chiheisen no mukou ni</i>

00:01:26.860 --> 00:01:34.830
<i>Beyond the horizon, where the white
clouds drift</i>

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:46.570
<i>Naranderu mirai wa itsumo soba ni aru kara</i>

00:01:34.830 --> 00:01:46.570
<i>The future is lined up and
it'll always be there by my side</i>

00:02:02.260 --> 00:02:02.560
A Hot, Amazing, New Production

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:05.290
A Hot, Amazing, New Production

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:05.290
"A Hot, Amazing, New Production"

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:08.460
A Hot, Amazing, New Production

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:18.310
So, it ended...

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:20.710
my first leading role.

00:02:20.710 --> 00:02:21.570
Sora...

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:26.370
Wh-What?

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:27.280
Iyaan...

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:28.180
Iyaan...

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:28.180
Iyaan...

00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:29.980
What?

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:32.180
Ian! Ian!

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:33.490
Ian?

00:02:33.560 --> 00:02:34.820
Yes, Ian, in the flesh!

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:35.720
He's here!

00:02:36.830 --> 00:02:40.760
By any chance, are you talking about Ian
who co-starred with Miss Layla in the movie?

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:41.690
Yes!

00:02:42.230 --> 00:02:44.400
You're not particularly his fan. Right, Sora?

00:02:44.400 --> 00:02:45.830
Well, I'm not particularly his...

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:46.800
Then, help us!

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:49.660
Okay, but what kind of help?

00:02:52.940 --> 00:02:55.070
I didn't know you meant this kind of help.

00:02:55.140 --> 00:02:56.270
There he is. There he is!

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:57.610
Where, where?

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:02.320
He is real!

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:04.550
An amazing million dollar smile!

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:05.610
America's lover.

00:03:08.560 --> 00:03:10.490
I can't imagine anyone other than Layla

00:03:10.490 --> 00:03:12.080
playing the main role for the next movie.

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:17.770
After all, this is the first movie
that I'm going to produce.

00:03:17.770 --> 00:03:20.330
I've already told you formally
that I'm not interested.

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:25.260
I know how you feel, Layla.

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:27.770
There it is again, the million dollar smile!

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:32.480
She is under pressure,
and puzzled over what to do.

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:36.280
So, Kalos, I want you to persuade her, too.

00:03:37.490 --> 00:03:43.290
I know you understand that coming to my
place is the best choice for her.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:46.320
Go ahead, please persuade her.

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.430
Layla, I think you should go.

00:03:49.430 --> 00:03:51.190
Yes, I think I should.

00:03:51.430 --> 00:03:52.800
What! So, okay?!

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:54.170
Bravo!

00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:55.670
Hey, it's me.

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:57.760
About Layla, she said okay.

00:03:58.110 --> 00:03:59.010
Yep.

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:00.340
Then, good-bye.

00:04:00.410 --> 00:04:01.810
Oh, good-bye.

00:04:01.980 --> 00:04:02.780
Excuse me.

00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:04.080
Sure. Wha-?

00:04:04.080 --> 00:04:05.440
What? Uh. Hey!

00:04:06.580 --> 00:04:07.850
Yes?

00:04:07.850 --> 00:04:09.380
When you said "go",
what did you mean by that?

00:04:09.380 --> 00:04:12.680
We're supposed to go to see the stage
equipment for a new production.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:14.680
You're kidding? No one told me!

00:04:14.990 --> 00:04:17.390
You just invited yourself to follow.

00:04:17.390 --> 00:04:18.230
Oh...

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:19.160
Then...

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:24.290
There is a profound reason
why we're doing this.

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:26.830
Please stop embarrassing yourself.

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:27.900
Yes...

00:04:28.500 --> 00:04:30.710
It's perfect. You should come with us.

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:32.840
What? Me?

00:04:32.840 --> 00:04:34.500
Why... me?

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:36.110
Wait, Layla!

00:04:36.910 --> 00:04:38.550
Oh, Mr. Ian also followed them.

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:39.750
Let's go, Sora.

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:42.440
Well... I would like to go, but...

00:04:48.660 --> 00:04:50.230
It's still in a trial stage.

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:51.450
Anyway, please take a look.

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:53.620
Hey, what took you so long?

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.720
This is...

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:03.160
This is the equipment for rope walking
in the new production, Arabian Nights.

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.900
In the climax, you will perform
action scenes on top of this.

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:08.480
Wow... It sounds amazing.

00:05:08.480 --> 00:05:10.670
But, after all, it's just rope walking.

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:13.880
It's nothing new to you.

00:05:13.880 --> 00:05:16.440
On the other hand, my next movie
will be a little different.

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:20.250
It moved!

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:24.250
By the time you perform,
more complicated moves will be possible.

00:05:24.860 --> 00:05:25.760
It sounds interesting.

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:30.030
I understand, Layla.

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:32.430
Then, I'll use a ship in my movie, too.

00:05:32.730 --> 00:05:33.840
Oh, it's me.

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:36.300
Prepare a ship that I can use for my movie.

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:37.430
Yep. A big one.

00:06:23.850 --> 00:06:25.620
This is pretty tricky.

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:29.290
You're going to have a one-on-one fight
with a bandit on top of this.

00:06:29.290 --> 00:06:30.660
Also, when you perform before the audience,

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:32.590
the ship will be enveloped in flames.

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:33.990
What?!

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:33.990
Fire?!

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:36.330
This is ridiculous, Layla.
I think you should stop...

00:06:36.330 --> 00:06:37.420
It sounds interesting.

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:38.730
Fire, fire!

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:41.300
Layla gets excited with scenes
that have fire in them!

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:42.300
Order gunpowder!

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:46.130
Yuri, let's start practicing immediately.

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.980
It seems I'm not the one you are going
to have a fight scene with.

00:06:48.980 --> 00:06:49.980
What?

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:52.140
Then, I wonder if they're going to
audition for my opponent's role.

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:56.180
Well, our main sponsor Mr. Kenneth
already nominated the person, and...

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:57.550
You're not saying...

00:06:57.550 --> 00:06:58.890
That's right.

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:03.490
The climax of Arabian Nights will be
co-starred by you and Sora.

00:07:03.490 --> 00:07:04.420
What!

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:10.160
I'm going to co-star with... Miss Layla...

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:14.300
Both you and Kenneth must be
out of your minds.

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:17.500
Even the Little Mermaid
could hardly be called a success.

00:07:18.810 --> 00:07:22.040
But, Mr. Kenneth says if
you and Sora are going to co-star,

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.810
he wouldn't mind doubling the budget.

00:07:25.150 --> 00:07:26.310
Why...

00:07:26.950 --> 00:07:27.750
Sora.

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:27.850
Yes!

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:27.850
Sora.

00:07:27.850 --> 00:07:28.650
Yes!

00:07:28.650 --> 00:07:29.950
Do you have confidence?

00:07:29.950 --> 00:07:30.820
Uh...

00:07:32.550 --> 00:07:35.020
If you don't have confidence,
excuse yourself from this role.

00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:37.490
Mr. Kenneth will understand.

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.260
Kalos, she cannot do this.

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:43.160
I think it's pitiful to pressure her
more than what we're doing now.

00:07:43.160 --> 00:07:45.190
Anyhow, it's a bit too much.

00:07:45.670 --> 00:07:49.630
Let's ask the scriptwriter to rewrite
the action scenes using Yuri instead of Sora.

00:07:49.700 --> 00:07:52.670
Mr. Kenneth will be very disappointed,

00:07:52.670 --> 00:07:53.800
but we have no choice.

00:07:54.010 --> 00:07:55.440
I...

00:07:55.440 --> 00:07:58.670
Miss Layla, I want to try it.

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:00.440
What?

00:08:00.880 --> 00:08:02.720
Let me do this, Miss Layla.

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:03.680
Please!

00:08:04.890 --> 00:08:06.350
Are you serious?

00:08:06.490 --> 00:08:07.490
I am!

00:08:07.490 --> 00:08:09.660
You're still a newcomer. How rude!

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:11.350
Right, Layla?

00:08:11.430 --> 00:08:13.330
I still don't have confidence, but...

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:15.000
You don't have confidence
and you still want to do it?

00:08:15.000 --> 00:08:15.930
Oh, my God!

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:18.230
Please test me.

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:20.770
If you're just going to give up
after the test,

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:22.570
you should resign now.

00:08:22.570 --> 00:08:25.370
It's a nuisance if you're going to prepare
yourself with half-baked attitude.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:28.070
That's right. That's right.

00:08:29.480 --> 00:08:31.410
Let me know when you make up your mind.

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:33.450
Wait, Layla!

00:08:35.080 --> 00:08:36.120
Excuse me...

00:08:36.120 --> 00:08:37.140
You should make up your own mind.

00:08:40.120 --> 00:08:41.920
Rope walking on a rolling ship...

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:43.990
that sounds tough.

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:46.120
Even Miss Layla fell from the rope.

00:08:46.230 --> 00:08:47.820
Sora, have you ever done rope walking?

00:08:47.960 --> 00:08:49.520
Well... a little...

00:08:49.960 --> 00:08:51.530
Hey, Naegino!

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:53.830
You're imitating a circus again!

00:08:54.070 --> 00:08:55.190
I'm sorry.

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:59.610
Sora, you're weird.

00:08:59.610 --> 00:09:00.510
What?

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:03.850
Usually, people don't volunteer for that
if that is all you did.

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:05.580
What? Really?

00:09:05.580 --> 00:09:07.880
If it was me, I'd definitely excuse myself.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.480
But, you're going to do it, right?

00:09:09.480 --> 00:09:11.190
Er... I wonder...

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:12.280
if it's impossible after all?

00:09:18.460 --> 00:09:22.660
I went over budget because of the
gunpowder I ordered for you.

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:25.360
From the beginning of the movie,
there's fire, fire, fire!

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:27.590
To the end, the whole movie
is fire, fire, fire!

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:28.270
What do you think?

00:09:28.270 --> 00:09:29.500
Excited, aren't you?

00:09:30.140 --> 00:09:31.440
Why...

00:09:31.440 --> 00:09:32.570
Why does it have to be Sora?

00:09:33.980 --> 00:09:37.470
Why am I so concerned about her?

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:39.980
Why?

00:09:40.480 --> 00:09:45.420
One day, it will be her
the audience comes to see.

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:52.590
Oh, it seems like you
finally made up your mind.

00:09:52.590 --> 00:09:53.420
Ian...

00:09:54.000 --> 00:09:55.500
Layla...

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:58.330
I hope you find a wonderful leading actress.

00:09:58.530 --> 00:09:58.970
Thank...

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:00.100
Thank... What?!

00:10:00.100 --> 00:10:00.900
Then, excuse me.

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:04.240
It's me!

00:10:04.240 --> 00:10:05.570
Cancel the gunpowder.

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:07.040
You can't?! Seriously?!

00:10:11.110 --> 00:10:12.670
You need someone to talk to?

00:10:15.220 --> 00:10:17.750
I've never felt this way.

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:19.240
I wonder what this is...

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:20.760
It's about Sora, isn't it?

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:23.060
She has something you don't.

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:23.920
What?

00:10:25.160 --> 00:10:27.250
She takes chances.

00:10:27.660 --> 00:10:28.800
You...

00:10:28.800 --> 00:10:32.030
Well, no one here at Kaleido Stage,
including myself,

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:33.760
takes chances like she does.

00:10:34.270 --> 00:10:35.390
Of course not.

00:10:35.870 --> 00:10:37.470
That's true.

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:39.870
But what Kalos wants from her is...

00:10:40.440 --> 00:10:41.840
Probably...

00:10:41.980 --> 00:10:45.210
Of course, I will support your ideas.

00:10:46.180 --> 00:10:48.050
Please take me to Kaleido Stage.

00:10:48.850 --> 00:10:51.340
As you wish.

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:55.190
Excuse me...

00:10:55.190 --> 00:10:58.230
In the end... do you think I should
excuse myself from this role?

00:10:58.230 --> 00:11:00.850
I thought I told you to
make up your own mind.

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:03.460
That's true.

00:11:03.460 --> 00:11:05.330
Then... this time, I will...

00:11:05.330 --> 00:11:06.160
Wait!

00:11:06.770 --> 00:11:07.930
Miss Layla...

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:10.300
Kalos, let's have a test.

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:13.370
I'm going to take a test, too,

00:11:13.370 --> 00:11:14.780
whether I can co-star with her.

00:11:14.780 --> 00:11:16.710
Then, I want you to decide.

00:11:16.910 --> 00:11:17.940
All right.

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:20.280
The deadline is a week from now. Is it okay?

00:11:20.450 --> 00:11:21.280
Y-Yes.

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.650
I look forward to seeing your performance.

00:11:25.090 --> 00:11:27.150
My performance?

00:11:45.270 --> 00:11:46.610
I'm gonna burn!

00:11:46.610 --> 00:11:49.680
Or, it's more like I can't breathe...

00:11:49.680 --> 00:11:51.410
Why...

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:53.180
I'm suffocating...

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:55.350
I'm gonna die.

00:11:55.350 --> 00:11:56.150
Zzzz...

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:57.450
Zzzz...

00:11:59.790 --> 00:12:01.760
First thing in the morning,
and you still treat me terrible.

00:12:01.860 --> 00:12:02.960
Which is more terrible?!

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:05.720
Thanks to you, I dreamt
I was burning to death!

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:07.700
I will teach you one good thing.

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:08.600
What?

00:12:08.600 --> 00:12:10.800
In a story like Arabian Nights,

00:12:10.800 --> 00:12:13.530
you should say you're covered in flames'
instead of saying 'burned to death'.

00:12:14.440 --> 00:12:15.400
I'm sorry.

00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:26.910
That's it. Very good.

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:28.380
Look at the front.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:30.150
Don't look down.

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:33.210
As I thought, Sora has a talent.

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:34.410
Yes, she does.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:38.120
But she still has a long way to go to
before she can co-star with Miss Layla.

00:12:38.490 --> 00:12:40.330
Since you're getting comfortable
with rope walking,

00:12:40.330 --> 00:12:42.900
Let's try rolling the ship a little
without the bar.

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:44.420
What! Already?!

00:12:44.500 --> 00:12:45.570
We don't have much time left.

00:12:45.570 --> 00:12:46.830
So, we have to keep going.

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:47.860
O-okay...

00:12:53.370 --> 00:12:54.340
One more time!

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:56.170
If this were a real stage,
you'd be barbecued.

00:12:56.680 --> 00:12:57.640
Barbecued?

00:13:00.150 --> 00:13:01.170
Okay, then!

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:23.740
Hey, she's doing it!

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:25.010
How she is doing, Ken?

00:13:25.010 --> 00:13:26.500
To tell the truth, she has a long way to go,

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:29.200
but her maneuvers are getting bold.

00:13:29.280 --> 00:13:31.370
I think she is getting used to using the rope.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.710
Hm... That's my girl, Sora.

00:13:33.920 --> 00:13:35.950
Oh, Mia, Anna.

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:37.390
Did you finish your lessons today?

00:13:37.390 --> 00:13:38.390
Yes.

00:13:38.390 --> 00:13:39.580
Why don't you have a short break?

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:41.390
Thank you.

00:13:41.390 --> 00:13:42.880
But, I want to practice a little more.

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.250
Sora!

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:46.430
Miss Sarah.

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:48.120
Sora, we're going.

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:50.730
What? Where are we going?

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:53.730
To overcome your weak points.

00:13:54.470 --> 00:13:56.700
My... weak points?

00:14:02.680 --> 00:14:03.780
Excuse me...

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:05.140
KATSU!

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:08.770
The resolved mind has no cares!

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:11.210
Thank you.

00:14:11.850 --> 00:14:14.860
This is Taurus' star cluster, Pleiades.

00:14:14.860 --> 00:14:15.820
And this star is Aldebaran.

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:16.790
Excuse me...

00:14:15.820 --> 00:14:16.790
And this star is Aldebaran.

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:18.880
AND WE ARE IN ALDEBARAN NOW!

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:20.130
What?

00:14:20.130 --> 00:14:23.290
Even though your body burns on this earth,
you don't feel the heat!

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:24.600
Yes, Master.

00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:25.290
What?

00:14:25.530 --> 00:14:27.930
We're not afraid of the flame.
We're not afraid of the flame!

00:14:28.840 --> 00:14:31.840
Your weak point is
your fear of being barbecued.

00:14:31.840 --> 00:14:32.770
What?

00:14:32.940 --> 00:14:35.380
You overcame that fear, Sora.

00:14:35.380 --> 00:14:37.110
If you're not afraid of falling into the flame,

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:38.910
you should be able to move more boldly.

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:41.810
Yes... Thank you very much.

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:45.110
I wonder if I'm misunderstanding something.

00:14:45.490 --> 00:14:47.020
Oh, no. Not at all.

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:47.360
Really?

00:14:47.020 --> 00:14:47.360
Oh, no. Not at all.

00:14:47.360 --> 00:14:47.920
Really?

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:48.020
Really?

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:48.020
Yes!

00:14:48.020 --> 00:14:48.820
Yes!

00:14:48.820 --> 00:14:51.020
Good. Then, good luck.

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:52.330
Yes!

00:15:04.810 --> 00:15:07.300
It's almost time to switch with Miss Layla.

00:15:07.440 --> 00:15:08.270
Okay.

00:15:08.880 --> 00:15:11.510
You're getting better, don't you think?
You're getting quite stable.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:12.510
Really?

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:13.710
Thank you, Ken.

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:17.280
What's wrong?

00:15:17.490 --> 00:15:19.010
You're not doing well?

00:15:19.550 --> 00:15:22.150
I started getting ideas how to do it right.

00:15:22.560 --> 00:15:24.320
Then, it's good.

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:25.630
Yes.

00:15:25.630 --> 00:15:28.530
But even if I manage to be able
to do rope walking,

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:31.000
I'm not sure if I can pass the test.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:35.700
I look forward to seeing your performance.

00:15:37.570 --> 00:15:40.540
If you can do this much in this short time...

00:15:40.540 --> 00:15:43.610
Don't you think Miss Layla will
acknowledge your performance?

00:15:43.610 --> 00:15:44.410
Yes.

00:15:46.150 --> 00:15:49.450
But I think something is missing...

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:50.480
Hm?

00:15:52.350 --> 00:15:53.690
Come on!

00:15:53.690 --> 00:15:54.750
What's wrong?

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:57.190
My locker won't open!

00:15:59.260 --> 00:16:00.260
Sora!

00:16:00.260 --> 00:16:01.390
Who'd do something like this?

00:16:02.200 --> 00:16:04.030
Didn't you do it yourself?

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:08.570
If you get hurt, you can, like,
get out of taking Miss Layla's test.

00:16:09.100 --> 00:16:10.130
So, you two did it.

00:16:10.200 --> 00:16:11.260
You're so mean!

00:16:11.710 --> 00:16:12.830
Diabolo...

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:15.140
Diabolo!

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:17.010
What's wrong with that girl?

00:16:17.010 --> 00:16:18.980
She's like, happy.

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:23.980
My performance...

00:16:25.020 --> 00:16:27.660
Pushing yourself too hard will not
produce a good result.

00:16:27.660 --> 00:16:30.090
Why don't you have a break?
Take a bath...

00:16:30.730 --> 00:16:31.690
Oh, sorry.

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:34.420
When you worry, you should hasten
to take a bath...

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:35.900
Oh, sorry.

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:40.260
Take a bath...

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:42.470
Sora! Hey, stop!

00:16:42.470 --> 00:16:43.570
What?! Fool, where are you?

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:43.670
Here!

00:16:43.570 --> 00:16:43.670
What?! Fool, where are you?

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:44.040
Here!

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:11.420
Your jump is too high!

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:13.200
Hey...

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:15.660
Ouch...

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:19.100
Look closely at your diabolo!

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:21.530
Good! Calm down!

00:17:24.710 --> 00:17:25.770
It's time to switch.

00:17:26.050 --> 00:17:28.210
Oh... yes.

00:17:30.720 --> 00:17:32.350
Finally. Tomorrow is the day.

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:33.480
I'm looking forward to it.

00:17:33.550 --> 00:17:34.520
Yes.

00:17:35.590 --> 00:17:36.920
Tomorrow...

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:39.450
My time for practice is over...

00:17:40.530 --> 00:17:41.900
Ken, thank you.

00:17:41.900 --> 00:17:43.900
Tomorrow, I will do my best.

00:17:43.900 --> 00:17:46.200
Don't you want to practice a little more?

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:49.100
Of course.

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:50.940
But... I...

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:52.010
Come with me.

00:17:52.010 --> 00:17:52.900
What?

00:17:56.310 --> 00:17:58.370
Yo! I've been waiting for you guys.

00:17:58.650 --> 00:17:59.440
Mr. Policeman.

00:18:00.110 --> 00:18:05.150
Hm? Excuse me, but, aren't you the doctor
who took care of my father?

00:18:05.150 --> 00:18:07.220
Yes. I'm Kate.

00:18:07.220 --> 00:18:08.150
It's nice to meet you.

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:10.320
Are you dating?

00:18:10.790 --> 00:18:12.220
Well...

00:18:12.490 --> 00:18:14.230
It's nothing like that.

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:16.200
We're just childhood friends.

00:18:16.460 --> 00:18:18.230
What do you mean when you said
you've been waiting?

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:19.770
When I consulted with Mr. Policeman,

00:18:19.770 --> 00:18:23.170
he told me that Kate knows someone
who works at Marine Park.

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:24.000
What?

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:27.060
All my family members are fans
of your Little Mermaid.

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:30.810
Oh... Thank you!

00:18:31.710 --> 00:18:33.770
Wow, this is a real one!

00:18:34.220 --> 00:18:35.580
How is it, Ken?

00:18:35.580 --> 00:18:36.780
It's perfect.

00:18:51.900 --> 00:18:52.870
Are you okay?

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:55.830
Okay, okay.

00:19:05.450 --> 00:19:07.240
Sorry, but it's almost time, I have to....

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:09.180
No, not at all.

00:19:09.580 --> 00:19:11.920
Thank you very much.

00:19:11.990 --> 00:19:14.120
Well, if you managed to do
this much in one week,

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:15.260
I think you did enough.

00:19:15.260 --> 00:19:16.220
It's true.

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:18.790
I still think your last jump is too high.

00:19:19.130 --> 00:19:20.760
You have to control yourself a little...

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:23.990
But, of course, that's just like Sora.

00:19:24.060 --> 00:19:26.260
Certainly, it makes me nervous.

00:19:26.670 --> 00:19:31.000
If you're not afraid of falling into the flame,
you should be able to move more boldly.

00:19:35.810 --> 00:19:36.710
Sora?

00:19:36.710 --> 00:19:38.230
Not afraid of falling?

00:19:40.050 --> 00:19:41.710
It may be okay to fall...

00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:42.780
What?

00:20:04.910 --> 00:20:06.470
Wonderful.

00:20:06.470 --> 00:20:08.180
You're amazing, Layla!

00:20:08.180 --> 00:20:09.900
Then, next is Sora.

00:20:09.980 --> 00:20:10.910
Yes.

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:47.540
Then, the next will be the finish!

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:49.480
Sink or swim.

00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:52.820
I have to give it a try.
I have to! I have to! I have to!

00:20:55.290 --> 00:20:56.420
It's high!

00:20:56.420 --> 00:20:57.690
That is too high.

00:20:57.690 --> 00:20:59.160
She will be bounced by the rope.

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:08.340
What?

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:30.360
Wow...

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:30.360
What?

00:21:30.360 --> 00:21:32.330
You're pretty good, Sora!

00:21:32.830 --> 00:21:34.560
You did better than I thought.

00:21:36.030 --> 00:21:37.730
So, Layla, what do you think?

00:21:37.730 --> 00:21:39.600
Can't you acknowledge
this kind of performance?

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:41.490
Not at all, Mr. Kenneth.

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:48.100
I'm looking forward to find out
what kind of stage Sora and I can do.

00:21:48.380 --> 00:21:49.470
Miss Layla...

00:21:53.850 --> 00:21:55.010
Miss Layla...

00:21:55.420 --> 00:21:56.420
It's true.

00:21:56.420 --> 00:21:58.680
You have something I don't possess.

00:21:58.850 --> 00:21:59.690
What?

00:21:59.690 --> 00:22:03.360
But, if you're going to appear
on stage with me,

00:22:03.360 --> 00:22:05.290
I expect you to prepare for it accordingly.

00:22:05.590 --> 00:22:06.460
Yes!

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:11.230
Then, I look forward to working with you.

00:22:14.440 --> 00:22:16.160
I look forward to working with you as well.

